{"discussions":[{"id":"adc433d0-a2d0-11f1-8080-800122b3b4c9","post":{"id":"adc433d0-a2d0-11f1-8080-800122b3b4c9","owner":{"id":"14141682","username":"ChinaTech","firstName":"Tech Leaders","lastName":"of China","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/13852779/5.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/13852779/5.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/13852779/5.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":57,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"d1cff17c-add9-4194-a06a-7cee22943b1c","created":"2026-08-28T11:07:37.741Z","message":{"text":"🤖 Tencent Pushes Deeper Into Open-Source AI\n\n👉 $0700.HK, a holding in the @ChinaTech Smart Portfolio, has released a preview of Hy4, a new open-source AI model designed for tasks including software engineering, research, and financial analysis.\n\n👉 The model uses a mixture-of-experts architecture with 770 billion parameters in total, while activating only around 49 billion for each request — an approach designed to combine scale with greater computational efficiency.\n\n👉 Tencent plans to integrate Hy4 into products including CodeBuddy and WorkBuddy, showing how the company is moving beyond model development toward embedding AI directly into its broader software ecosystem.\n\n👉 The release follows Tencent’s Hunyuan 3.0 launch earlier this year and reflects the company’s increasing investment in AI as competition intensifies across China’s technology sector.\n\n👉 Open-source models could become an important part of that strategy by encouraging wider developer adoption, accelerating experimentation, and creating more opportunities for Tencent’s AI capabilities to spread across enterprise and consumer applications.\n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\n\nChina’s AI competition is increasingly moving beyond who can build the biggest model.\n\nThe more important question may be who can turn models into widely used tools, developer platforms, and commercial products. Tencent’s ability to combine AI research with one of China’s largest digital ecosystems could make distribution just as important as raw model performance.\n\n✨ The @ChinaTech Smart Portfolio provides diversified exposure to leading Chinese technology companies across AI, cloud computing, semiconductors, digital platforms, and next-generation applications.\n\n🔗 Read more: https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/chinas-tencent-releases-new-open-source-ai-model-coding-research-tasks-2026-08-28/\n\nPast performance is not an indication of future results.","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-28T11:07:37.741Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/chinatech/c035197a-b00a-4120-a2dd-f5567b72cd31-2026-08-28.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/chinatech/c035197a-b00a-4120-a2dd-f5567b72cd31-2026-08-28.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"2339","symbolName":"0700.HK","displayName":"Tencent","updated":"2026-09-01T09:49:15.946Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":2339,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/2339/35x35.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/2339/50x50.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/2339/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/2339/2339_006CB6_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#006CB6","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}}],"mentions":[{"user":{"id":"14141682","username":"ChinaTech","firstName":"Tech Leaders","lastName":"of China","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/13852779/5.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/13852779/5.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/13852779/5.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":57,"piLevel":0},"isDirect":false}],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None"},"commentsData":{"reactionPaging":{"totalCount":2},"comments":[{"entity":{"message":{"text":"And the good part about Tencent is that they keep buying back shares. So diligent. ","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-02T12:24:10.744Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None","id":"8fe7ed84-e88f-4220-ac46-bfeff3139872","owner":{"id":"3112137","username":"CCalle","firstName":"Cristia","lastName":"Calle Mercado","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/2854589/7.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/2854589/7.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/2854589/7.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":191,"piLevel":5},"obsoleteId":"8fe7ed84-e88f-4220-ac46-bfeff3139872","parent":{"id":"adc433d0-a2d0-11f1-8080-800122b3b4c9","obsoleteId":"adc433d0-a2d0-11f1-8080-800122b3b4c9","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-02T12:24:10.448Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"I have both and buy more","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-28T13:38:03.067Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"06c5c4c9-bbf2-48bc-a0b1-10b1c47445e3","owner":{"id":"46197427","username":"helmutwiessner","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/46112007/1.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic